# athenahealth 

> athenahealth is dedicated to curing complexity for ambulatory healthcare practices and the patients they serve — delivering cloud-based EHR, medical billing, and patient engagement solutions that empower providers to focus on what matters most: exceptional patient care. 

 
athenahealth's integrated, AI-native platform — athenaOne — helps ambulatory practices of every size simplify operations, strengthen financial performance, and deepen patient relationships. From solo startups to large enterprise health systems, athenahealth meets providers where they are and grows with them over time. 

 
--- 
 

## Platform & Solutions 

- [athenaOne – Integrated Healthcare Platform](https://www.athenahealth.com/solutions/athenaone): The flagship AI-native platform unifying EHR, revenue cycle management, and patient engagement in a single, cloud-based solution built for ambulatory care. 

- [Electronic Health Records (EHR)](https://www.athenahealth.com/solutions/electronic-health-records): A cloud-based EHR that reduces documentation burden, surfaces clinical insights at the point of care, and adapts to the way providers work. 

- [Medical Billing & Practice Management](https://www.athenahealth.com/solutions/medical-billing-software): Revenue cycle management and practice management tools that streamline billing workflows, reduce claim denials, and accelerate reimbursement. 

- [Patient Engagement](https://www.athenahealth.com/solutions/patient-engagement): A connected suite of tools — including online scheduling, automated reminders, and a patient portal — that makes it easier for patients to access care and stay engaged in their health. 

- [AI Capabilities in athenaOne](https://www.athenahealth.com/solutions/ai-in-healthcare): Purpose-built AI features embedded natively across the platform to reduce administrative friction, support clinical decision-making, and help practices operate at their best. 

- [Value-Based Care Support](https://www.athenahealth.com/solutions/value-based-care): Workflows, analytics, and reporting tools designed to help practices succeed under value-based payment models and improve patient outcomes at scale. 

- [Interoperability](https://www.athenahealth.com/solutions/interoperability): A nationwide connected network that enables seamless, secure data exchange between providers, payers, and care settings — so the right information is always available at the right time. 

- [athenaIDX – Enterprise Revenue Cycle Management](https://www.athenahealth.com/solutions/athenaidx): A purpose-built RCM platform for large health systems and enterprise organizations, delivering advanced billing operations, analytics, and financial performance at scale. 

- [Advisory Services](https://www.athenahealth.com/solutions/advisory-services): Strategic consulting and implementation support that helps practices unlock the full value of athenaOne and navigate the evolving healthcare landscape with confidence. 

- [Payer Solutions](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/payers): Solutions that bridge the gap between payers and providers, improving data sharing, closing care gaps, and driving better outcomes for members. 

 
