## Who We Serve 


### By Organization Type 

- [Startup Practices](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/startup-practices): Purpose-built tools and onboarding support to help new practices launch with confidence and build a strong financial and clinical foundation from day one. 

- [Small Medical Practices](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/small-practices): Intuitive, affordable solutions that give independent and small-group providers the same operational power as larger organizations — without the overhead. 

- [Medium to Large Medical Groups](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/medical-groups): Scalable technology and services that grow alongside multi-provider organizations, streamlining complex workflows across locations and specialties. 

- [Enterprises & Health Systems](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/enterprise-health-systems): Enterprise-grade capabilities that help large, complex health systems standardize operations, surface actionable insights, and deliver consistent, high-quality care. 

- [Federally Qualified Health Centers (FQHCs)](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/fqhc): Tailored solutions that help community health centers meet rigorous compliance requirements while expanding access to care for underserved populations. 

- [Member-Centric Care Organizations](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/member-centric-care): Solutions built for organizations committed to whole-person, value-aligned care — supporting better coordination, outcomes, and member satisfaction. 

 

### By Specialty 

- [Behavioral Health](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/behavioral-health): Specialized EHR and billing capabilities designed to meet the unique documentation, compliance, and care coordination needs of behavioral health providers. 

- [Primary Care](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/primary-care): Solutions that reduce administrative burden and support the longitudinal patient relationships at the heart of family medicine, internal medicine, and general practice. 

- [Pediatrics](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/pediatrics): Pediatric-specific workflows, growth chart tracking, and immunization management built to support the distinctive rhythms of child and adolescent care. 

- [Women's Health](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/womens-health): Comprehensive tools for OB/GYN and women's health providers, supporting everything from routine wellness visits to complex prenatal and postpartum care. 

- [Orthopedics](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/orthopedics): Streamlined documentation, templating, and billing tools purpose-built for the fast-paced, procedure-heavy workflows of orthopedic practices. 

- [Urgent Care](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve/urgent-care): High-throughput tools designed to keep urgent care centers running efficiently — from rapid check-in and documentation to seamless billing and follow-up. 

- [View All Specialties](https://www.athenahealth.com/who-we-serve): A full index of all medical specialties supported by athenahealth's platform, with tailored content for each care setting. 

 
